WEBVTT

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.600
You don't have to do this.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:31.900
You don't have to go back
and live with your mean uncle!

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.030
My Uncle and I are family.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:38.950
Family living together
is nothing out of the ordinary.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.660
But it is!

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.710
After the things your aunt
and uncle did to hurt you two,

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.920
you can't say they're family!

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.930
Please.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.350
If I don't,

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:04.430
he'll destroy my <i>Nii-Nii</i>'s room.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.900
So please, don't try to stop me.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.700
Satoko!

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:23.240
You'll come to school, right?
You'll walk with me?

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.080
Of course.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:29.130
I'll meet you at the bottom
of the stone steps.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.300
Sorry to bother you so late, Mion-<i>chan</i>.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.680
Oh, no, it's fine!

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:49.100
My Old Gran's already fast asleep, though.
Could you come by tomorrow morning?

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.770
I would, but...

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.280
Is everything okay?

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:58.820
There's just this rumor
goin' around the village.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:04.120
How 'bout I tell you, and you decide if we
should tell Oryo-<i>san </i>about it?

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.950
So it's something serious.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.330
Well, that's 'cause it involves the Hojos.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:15.960
Someone says they spotted Teppei Hojo
at his house in the village.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.300
We're sure it was him?

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:23.970
Yeah. Apparently, he yelled at 'em.
Definitely something he'd do.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:31.270
That's all I came for. Tell Oryo-<i>san</i>
if you think she should know.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.730
Satoko...

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:13.920
"Higurashi: When They Cry - SOTSU"

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.460
"Monday, June 13th, 1983"

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.380
I'm going to school.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:24.010
Satoko! You sure you don't
want me to walk with ya?

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:27.140
I'm just walking to school.
No need to make a fuss.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:29.970
But it ain't like school is safe!

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:34.640
And what if someone
assaults ya on the way there?

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.980
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:41.780
Knowing you're here for me
gives me the strength to go on.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.990
There's nothin' else I can do for you?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.740
Just stay here, please.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.370
No matter what horrible things
might happent o me out there,

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:53.000
I can come home to family.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.710
You don't know how much that means to me.

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.130
Really?

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.670
I'm off, then, Uncle.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:08.180
Mii-<i>chan</i>! Sorry we're late!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.680
Mornin', Mion!

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:13.600
Really, you guys?
I was just about to ditch you.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:16.560
Sorry! We can make it if we run, though!

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.310
I didn't <i>want </i>to have to run this early.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.150
So, why're you late?

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:26.650
Keiichi-<i>kun </i>slept in late
'cause he was dreaming about Satoko!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.490
C'mon, Rena! You're gonna make
her think it was something weird!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.700
What's up?

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.710
Huh?

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:40.250
Nothing, just surprised you're
<i>that </i>smitten with Satoko.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.170
I <i>said </i>it was nothing weird--

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.670
Crap, we really gotta run,
or we'll be late!

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:46.840
Let's go!

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:04.070
We'd better hurry,
or we'll both be late!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.320
Rika...

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.700
I won't be able to walk
to school with you.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.700
Why?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.740
My uncle wants me to run a few errands.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.830
What? But you can
just do that after school!

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.960
I have to go get them now.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.750
You know how quick he is to anger.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.050
Please, Satoko.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:31.510
Just come to school with me,
and I'll walk you home this afternoon.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.760
I have to do what my uncle says.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.100
No, you don't!

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:38.810
Go off to school without me.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.770
I wanted to tell you
in person, that's all.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:46.820
I'll come to school when
I'm finished with these errands.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:10.590
You're late, Furude-<i>san</i>.
And where is Hojo-<i>san</i>?

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.510
Rika-<i>chan</i>?

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:18.640
Satoko... might be a little late today.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.270
Okay.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:33.740
Rika-<i>chan</i>, is Satoko gonna come for lunch?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.580
If Rika-<i>chan </i>doesn't wanna tell us,
we'll just have to wait for her.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.540
It might not be
that big of a deal, anyway.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.800
Hey, Mion. You know something, don't you?

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:47.920
Why do you think that?

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.380
You've been acting weird all morning.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:57.510
Last night, I heard a rumor from
someone on the neighborhood council.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.640
A rumor?

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.100
So Satoko has this uncle...

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.940
By uncle, you mean the one who beat her?!

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:08.020
Yeah. So you heard about him already, huh?

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.710
So Satoko's uncle, Teppei Hojo,

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.970
is apparently back in Hinamizawa.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.010
Satoko!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.890
Whatever is the matter, Keiichi-<i>san</i>?

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:45.850
We were worried about you!
Where've you been all morning?!

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:49.860
You're quite the worrywart, aren't you?

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:52.940
Satoko-<i>chan</i>...

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.450
Are you okay?

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.610
Do forgive me for the trouble.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:00.580
I was merely running errands
for my uncle, that's all.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.410
Errands? On a school day?!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.500
Enough of that. Let's have lunch.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.250
I'm feeling quite peckish.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.510
Satoko...

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.560
Hey, we're all friends. Right, guys?

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.520
Yeah.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:31.610
Rika-<i>chan</i>, could you tell us
what's going on now?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.500
Dammit!

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:49.420
What he's doing is child abuse, right?
Can't we report it or something?

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:52.380
That's right! If we can find proof,
the police will--

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.300
We did report it.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.880
I went to Child Welfare Services
in winter of last year.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.930
You did? What'd they do?

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.930
They sent a social worker
to check it out right away.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:05.020
They interviewed Satoko and Satoshi...

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:07.940
...then their aunt and uncle.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.360
Wait, why would they
talk to the adults, too?

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:14.360
They said they wanted to "get both sides"
before making a decision.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.240
How wonderfully "fair."

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.780
So what did Child Welfare say in the end?

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.780
--"We'll keep an eye on them."
--What? The hell does that mean?!

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:24.330
They were beating them,
but it didn't leave any marks or anything.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:27.790
And it wasn't like anyone
got recordings of his tirades.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.920
Since the violence only happened at home,
there were no other witnesses.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.980
What happened after that?

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:53.650
You know what happened.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:56.690
The abuse got even worse.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:59.070
Reporting didn't work.

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.660
Is there really nothing
we can do to help her?

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.350
S-Satoko!

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:33.150
I'm quite all right.
I just took a tumble, that's all.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:35.520
Wh-Who's the bastard
that did this to you?!

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:38.400
I'll tear 'em to shreds!

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.740
Don't, Uncle!

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:45.990
When I'm through with that bitch,
they're gonna <i>wish </i>they were dead!

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.660
And they'll never do this bullshit again!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.960
I'm fine, Uncle!
This is pratcially nothing!

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.090
Outta the way, Satoko!

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.090
Please, Uncle! Don't make a fuss!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.130
Let go!

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:04.890
If I let go of you, I'll lose this home
and my family <i>again</i>!

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:08.520
Please, don't leave me all alone.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:16.520
I-I just... I...

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:20.110
I'm all right, really.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:24.490
After all, this house has
my family in it and no one else.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.870
I'm sorry, Satoko.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.580
I can forget all the bad things
that happened

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.460
and live a nice, quiet life with you.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:39.630
That's the only thing I want now.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:21.880
Good morning, class.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.470
Furude-<i>san</i>...

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.260
Is Hojo-<i>san </i>going to be late again today?

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.480
Study on your own for a bit, everyone.

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.810
Let's talk, Furude-<i>san</i>.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:44.650
Is the rumor about Hojo-<i>san</i>'s uncle true?

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:47.030
I know what's going on, then.

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:49.070
--So?
--Huh?

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:52.790
If you know all that,
then what can you do to help her?

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.000
I'll go visit her at home.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.540
If I see something's wrong...

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:02.380
You're gonna call Child
Welfare Services on him, right?

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:05.340
They won't do anything
if you don't have proof of abuse.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.180
Guys...

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:09.090
I told you to study on your own!

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:10.930
Screw studying right now!

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.430
Satoko's way more important!

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:16.520
I need to know what Hojo-<i>san</i>'s
home environment is like

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.600
so I can make a truthful report!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:24.530
I also think we should let Chie-<i>sensei</i>
handle this right now.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.650
Me, too.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.700
I agree with Rena.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.200
If you're okay with that,
Rika-<i>chan</i>, then okay...

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.790
Class Representative, please take
everyone back to the classroom.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.210
C'mon.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:59.480
You sure you shouldn't be lyin' down?

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:04.320
I felt a bit feverish this morning,
but I'm all right now.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.200
Let's check... where's that thermometer?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.740
I don't have a fever.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:16.240
Well then, if you feel good tomorrow,
you can go back to school.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.540
And I'll walk you there and back!
You can count on me!

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.920
I don't want to go.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.750
I don't want to go to school.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:30.880
Wait... are you sayin' that even
your classmates are bullyin' you?!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:35.930
Everyone in my class
is from Hinamizawa, you know.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:40.100
And your teacher ain't doin' anything?
She's just lettin' it happen?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:45.230
If she was just ignoring it, then maybe
I could still get her to help...

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.940
Even your teacher's in on it?!

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:52.780
Hello! Are you here, Hojo-<i>san</i>?

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.160
The hell do you want, bitch?!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:03.880
Are you Satoko-<i>san</i>'s uncle?

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.590
My name is Chie. I'm a teacher
at the school here in Hinamizawa.

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:08.840
You her teacher?

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:11.420
Can I speak with Satoko-<i>san</i>?

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:15.470
What? Why the hell you wanna talk to her?

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:20.310
She didn't come to school today,
and nobody called to report her absent.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.690
Yeah, she's got a cold!

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:26.650
She's got a full-blown fever
and is feelin' like shit!

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:30.490
I see. Do you think she'll make it
to school tomorrow?

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.900
The hell should I know?!

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.990
We'll figure that out tomorrow!

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.080
Satoko...

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.290
Don't worry, I told her off! She's gone!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.040
Thank you.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:52.880
But that won't be enough to stop it.
Who knows what they'll do to me next?

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:58.850
I don't care if they all band together
against ya, I'll fight 'em off!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.520
I knew you'd protect me, Uncle.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.530
Chie-<i>sensei</i>!

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.740
You were all waiting for me?

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.070
How was Satoko? Is she okay?!

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:18.990
I... didn't get to see her.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.410
But now we know what's going on.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:24.870
Satoko's bastard uncle is
keeping her locked up in her house!

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.120
Yeah.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.960
I'm going to call Child Welfare Services.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:33.670
If I explain the situation to them,
I'm sure they'll do something about it.

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:35.970
I wasn't able to help...

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:38.800
But if you called, Sensei, then maybe...

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.730
Hello?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:51.020
What? Child Welfare Services?

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:55.900
The hell you talking about?
I don't got nothing to do with that!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:59.160
What? A welfare check?
I don't give a damn!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:03.410
Uncle, let me talk to them.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:07.250
You don't need to do that!
I'll handle this ridiculous--

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.920
--H-Hey...
--Hello?

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:12.250
Forgive the ruckus. This is Satoko.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:16.680
You have questions for me, correct?

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:21.760
Of course, I have nothing to hide.
Ask me whatever you like.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.560
I convinced them it was all
a misunderstanding.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:31.770
The hell was CWS callin' us
in the first place?

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.440
There's only one reason.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:37.150
This is just another way
the village is trying to bully me.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:39.700
What?! This is their doin'?!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.780
This won't be good.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:48.290
CWS has the power to tear you and I apart.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:51.580
The hell?! Ain't no way they can
get away with that! It can't be legal!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:55.880
The village is lying to CWS.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:19:02.180
Still, we should be careful so as to not
give them a real reason to separate us.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.600
"Wednesday, June 15th, 1983"

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:17.900
Good morning, Rika.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:24.080
Good morning, Satoko!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.240
Come, now, let's go to school.

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:27.950
Yeah, let's!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.370
Are you okay now?

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:37.010
Yes, thank you for asking.
My cold has cleared up completely.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:38.670
That's not what I meant.

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:43.350
You should've gotten a call from CWS.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.010
What of it?

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:49.640
I explained to them that they were
mistaken about my current situation.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.400
"They'll keep an eye on them"?!
What the hell?!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:20:00.360
Apparently, Child Welfare Services
made a phone call to Satoko's house.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:01.570
And that was it.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:05.030
So they decided to just
"wait and see"? That's crazy!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:08.870
My, you all are loud this morning!

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:09.790
Satoko?!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:12.120
Quiet down, please.

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:15.290
Satoko-<i>chan</i>! Are you okay?

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.930
How very sad.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:27.930
T'would seem that the human Satoko Hojo
can now only feel happiness

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:32.560
when she is thrusting herself into despair
and being lavished with pity.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:36.190
Now, she moves the pieces around the board
and fiddles with the hearts of others

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:39.070
in blind pursuit of that pleasure...

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.740
You brat...

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.160
Huh?

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.120
Wh-What's wrong, Satoko?

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.620
Satoko, are you okay?

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:58.340
So, she is no longer human.
She has become a <i>witch</i>.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.430
Satoko!

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.850
A-Are you okay, Satoko?!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.600
No!

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.560
Hey, Satoko!

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.280
No!

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:23.280
